{"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK","doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"How long, in seconds, to wait for the stream’s "},{"code":"EXT-X-PROGRAM-DATE-TIME","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"wallclock","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"-timebase session before concluding the stream carries none."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A session is normally started before the content player has loaded its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source, so the scheduler’s first ticks see no PDT even on a stream that does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry it. Those ticks make no scheduling decision, rather than matching breaks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"against the system clock — which runs ahead of the live playhead by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"stream’s latency and would fire a break early (PLAYG-360)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"backstop, not a fixed delay","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":". The SDK stops waiting at whichever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"comes first: content has been playing for ~1s and still exposes no PDT (direct"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evidence about the stream — "},{"code":"DA-PDT-MISSING","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is emitted once and the clock"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"takes over immediately, so a join-in-progress break is not delayed below the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tune-in minimum), or this window elapses (the backstop for a player that never"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"starts)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" to fall back to the system clock immediately. Has no effect on","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pts"},{"text":"-timebase manifests. Mirrors the web ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig\/pdtgraceseconds"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:14OptiViewAdsSDK0abC6ConfigV15pdtGraceSecondsSdvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"pdtGraceSeconds"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"}],"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsSDK"}],"title":"pdtGraceSeconds"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig\/pdtGraceSeconds","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK/documentation/OptiViewAdsSDK/OptiViewAdsConfig":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/optiviewadssdk.OptiViewAdsSDK\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsSDK\/OptiViewAdsConfig","url":"\/documentation\/optiviewadssdk\/optiviewadsconfig","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Org-level SDK configuration, fixed for the lifetime of th